  "body": "## What changed\n\nAccept `.solidcraft` as a case-insensitive alias of `.sc` in the existing model importer.\nOffer the alias in the native Model Open filter and accept it for viewport drops.\nList the alias in the MCP import path description.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe import router and native GUI extension list recognized only `.sc`.\nSolidcraft can save the same design container with the `.solidcraft` extension.\n\n## Native Model Open filter screenshots\n\nThe captures show a native dialog harness on Linux/Xvfb.\nThe harness compiles each revision's `mesh_dialog` and `MODEL_EXTENSIONS` with the unchanged production `file_dialog.rs`.\nIt opens the real rfd/Zenity file chooser.\n\nBefore (`abe24ff09`): the Mesh filter hides `design.solidcraft`.\n\n![Before: native Mesh filter hides design.solidcraft](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e6f6caa87f70da7df92159895f1abf79a9274ab2/2448/pr-2448-model-open-before.png)\n\nAfter (`e6c93d9d3`): the Mesh filter shows `design.solidcraft`.\n\n![After: native Mesh filter shows design.solidcraft](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e6f6caa87f70da7df92159895f1abf79a9274ab2/2448/pr-2448-model-open-after.png)\n\nBoth captures use the same directory and active Mesh filter.\n`bracket.stl` and `design.sc` remain visible. `readme.txt` remains hidden.\nThe files were browsed only.\nThe images are stored only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch at `e6f6caa87f70da7df92159895f1abf79a9274ab2`.\n\n## Tests\n\nThese pins failed before the fix and passed after it:\n\n- `solidcraft_extension_routes_to_the_sc_importer_case_insensitively`\n- `mcp_solidcraft_extension_refuses_a_damaged_design_by_name`\n- `mcp_solidcraft_extension_opens_the_cached_final_body`\n- `a_solidcraft_extension_drop_uses_the_model_filter_case_insensitively`\n\nThe successful MCP pin imports the sample with its thumbnail JSON and PNG entries.\nRestoring upstream `geometry/import/mod.rs` made all three app pins fail.\nRestoring the fix made all three pass.\nRestoring upstream `state.rs` made the GUI alias pin fail.\nRestoring the fix made it pass.\nThe app import suite and GUI drop suite pass.\nClippy passes for `camcraft-app` and `camcraft-ui` with all targets and warnings denied.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes all 47 steps on Linux.\nThe run has 1,666 passed tests, no failed tests, and 13 ignored tests.\nThe UI library suite and GPU checks pass.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe `.nc` and `.cl` diff stat is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nOpening the native dialog from the running application was not exercised manually.\nBrowser Solidcraft import remains unavailable through the existing native-only reader.\nThe original heavy `.sc` success tests were not rerun.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #1330, #1798, #2092, #2134, #2149, #2185, #2253, #2256 and #2370 touch the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nTheir changes leave `format_from_path`, `s_import`, `MODEL_EXTENSIONS` and the drop tests untouched.\n\nEffort: low\n\nChangelog: Import Solidcraft designs saved as .solidcraft through MCP, Model Open and viewport drops.\n\nFixes #2445\n",
